Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:03.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Are you from the Star Wars universe?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:03.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你来自《星球大战》的宇宙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.25,0:00:04.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.25,0:00:04.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:06.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Were you in the original trilogy? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:06.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有在第一个三部曲中吗？ -有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.96,0:00:10.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is there a picture of you in my wallet wearing a metal bikini?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.96,0:00:10.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我皮夹里有你 穿金属比基尼的照片吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God, I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望没有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:18.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, I'm not Princess Leia. -Okay, my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:18.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-错 我不是莉亚公主 -好 换我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:20.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you in all six Star Wars movies?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:20.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}六部《星球大战》电影都有你？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.77,0:00:22.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes. -Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.77,0:00:22.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对 -有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.36,0:00:24.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are you a droid? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.36,0:00:24.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你是机器人吗？ -是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.78,0:00:27.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you kind of look like a shiny Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.78,0:00:27.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看起来像发亮的谢尔顿？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.11,0:00:30.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.11,0:00:30.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:33.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-C-3P0. -You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:33.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-C3PO -答对了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:38.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's preposterous. I do not resemble C-3P0.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:38.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太荒谬了！我根本不像C3PO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.37,0:00:41.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't get me wrong, I'm flattered, I just don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.37,0:00:41.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别误会 我很荣幸 只是不觉得像
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.08,0:00:45.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CELL PHONE RINGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.09,0:00:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leslie Winkle. Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.09,0:00:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱斯丽温克尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:51.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've reached Friends with Benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:51.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里是〝炮友〞专线
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.26,0:00:55.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For a booty call, press 1 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.26,0:00:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想打炮 请按1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:01.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What exactly does that expression mean, "friends with benefits"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:01.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝炮友〞这个词究竟是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.27,0:01:04.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does he provide her with health insurance?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.27,0:01:04.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们是一起放鞭炮的朋友吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.44,0:01:10.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, imagine you maintained a friendship with someone you had sex with...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.44,0:01:10.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想像…你和某人上床后 还能维持朋友关系
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:13.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but you were free to date whoever you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:13.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你们还能和别人约会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:16.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, I can't imagine any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:16.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 完全无法想像
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.91,0:01:19.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, back to the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.91,0:01:19.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 游戏继续
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:21.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I believe it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:21.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想轮到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.08,0:01:23.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You may begin your questions whenever you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.08,0:01:23.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们准备好就发问
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:25.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you Spock?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:25.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是斯波克？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:31.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't like this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:31.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不喜欢这个游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.68,0:01:34.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.68,0:01:34.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}刚才玩到哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.60,0:01:37.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Aren't you leaving for your booty call? -No, it was something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.60,0:01:37.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-她不是约你去打炮？ -不 是别的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.93,0:01:40.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why does everything have to be about sex with you? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.93,0:01:40.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你干嘛老谈到性？真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.85,0:01:42.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whose turn is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.85,0:01:42.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}轮到谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.23,0:01:43.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We're up to you. HOWARD: Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.23,0:01:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-给你决定 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.64,0:01:45.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Just start. -Okay, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.64,0:01:45.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-问吧 -好 我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:48.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you from a TV series?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:48.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是电视影集角色吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.78,0:01:50.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She dumped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.78,0:01:50.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她甩了我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.32,0:01:52.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CRYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.45,0:01:57.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I bet he's someone from Babylon 5. We're never gonna get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.45,0:01:57.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定是《五号战星》的人物 我们死也猜不到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.48,0:02:23.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What happened with Leslie? Why did she dump you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.48,0:02:23.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱斯丽怎么了？为何甩掉你？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:28.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. She just said, "Howard, Mama's a rolling stone."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:28.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道 她只说 〝霍华德 老娘有新欢了〞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:33.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then her call waiting beeped, and she was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:33.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后她有插拨 电话就断了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:36.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:36.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.95,0:02:39.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you were in a non-emotional relationship...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.95,0:02:39.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们若没有感情上的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.53,0:02:43.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...then why are you having what appears to be an emotional response?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.53,0:02:43.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为何会有如此情感受伤的反应？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.54,0:02:46.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, he obviously had feelings for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.54,0:02:46.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 显然他对她有感情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.38,0:02:51.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course I had feelings for her. I saw her naked, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.38,0:02:51.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我对她当然有感情 我连她裸体都看过了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:54.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, look, you just need to get your mind off it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:54.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你转移注意力就不会难过了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:57.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you wanna go to the comic-book store, maybe see a movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:57.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想去漫画书店吗？或是看电影？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.22,0:02:59.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't wanna go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.22,0:02:59.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我哪儿都不想去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.43,0:03:01.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.43,0:03:01.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.18,0:03:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'm given to understand that there's an entire city in Nevada...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.18,0:03:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我确定内华达州有一整个城市
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...designed specifically to help people like Howard forget their problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:09.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}特别规划成帮霍华德这种人忘记烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.48,0:03:13.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We can replace them with new problems such as alcoholism...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.48,0:03:13.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}进而用新烦恼取代 例如酗酒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:16.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...gambling addiction and sexually-transmitted diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:16.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}赌博成瘾以及性病
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:23.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it me or was that Sheldon's way of saying, "Vegas, baby"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:23.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我会错意 还是谢尔顿在暗示〝去赌城浪一下〞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:27.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I've never been there, have you? -Me? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:27.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我没去过 你呢？ -我也没
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.58,0:03:31.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just got "Vegas, baby!" from Vince Vaughn in Swingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.58,0:03:31.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我那句〝去赌城浪一下〞是在模仿电影
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:37.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That could be fun, and I know my weekend's wide open now that....
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:37.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许会很好玩 反正我周末都有空 因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.43,0:03:39.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.05,0:03:42.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, let's do this. Let's go to Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.05,0:03:42.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就这样吧 我们去拉斯维加斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.85,0:03:44.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now? Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.85,0:03:44.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在就走？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.31,0:03:46.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why not? People do things right now all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.31,0:03:46.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有何不可？很多人都是说走就走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.77,0:03:48.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why can't we be "right now" people too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.77,0:03:48.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么我们不能那样？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.81,0:03:51.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go home, pack a bag, and we'll be "right now" people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.81,0:03:51.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}回家打包 我们〝说走就走〞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:54.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to stop at the drugstore to refill a prescription...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:54.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我先去药局把药配好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.82,0:03:57.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but after that, we'll go right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.82,0:03:57.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后我们〝说走就走〞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.78,0:04:02.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What do you say, Howard? -I say, Vegas, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.78,0:04:02.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你认为呢？霍华德 -我…〝去赌城浪一下〞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.95,0:04:06.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are you gonna tell your mother? -SeaWorld, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.95,0:04:06.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要怎么告诉你妈？ -〝去海洋世界浪一下〞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Sheldon, are you coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你来不来？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:17.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd rather have a blowfly lay eggs and hatch larvae in my auditory canal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:17.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我宁可让绿头苍蝇在我外耳道 产卵并孵化幼虫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:21.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great, we'll bring you back a T-shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:21.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我会帮你买纪念T恤
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.52,0:04:26.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.52,0:04:26.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.89,0:04:29.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.89,0:04:29.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.81,0:04:31.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.81,0:04:31.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.81,0:04:34.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And how are you this fine evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.81,0:04:34.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你今晚愉快吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.15,0:04:37.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Great. -Good, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.15,0:04:37.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-很开心 -好 我很欣慰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:39.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Really? Are you drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:39.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？你喝醉了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.99,0:04:41.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just in a good mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.99,0:04:41.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是心情好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.66,0:04:44.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}While my compatriots are in Las Vegas...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.66,0:04:44.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的同胞们在拉斯维加斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:48.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I will be enjoying a blissful evening in my personal Fortress of Solitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:48.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在这幸福的夜晚 我将独享我的孤寂堡垒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's Superman's big ice thingy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:52.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是超人的冰块屋 对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:55.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I'm in such a good mood, I'm actually finding your tenuous grasp...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:55.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我心情好到连你英文字汇的浅薄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.00,0:04:59.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of the English language folksy and charming today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.00,0:04:59.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都令我觉得土得可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.01,0:05:02.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mmm. What smells so good?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.01,0:05:02.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么香味？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:06.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is the intoxicating aroma of Kadhai Paneer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:06.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是印度咖哩乳酪丸的醉人香气
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:10.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A perfect culinary representation of the freedom this evening holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:10.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}完美地呈现了今晚的自由气息
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:13.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not only is it Indian cuisine, which Koothrappali loathes...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:13.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它不只是拉吉痛恨的印度菜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:15.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it contains a generous helping of peanuts...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:15.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还内含的大量花生食材
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.77,0:05:19.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which would reduce Wolowitz to a wheezing 97-pound blister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.77,0:05:19.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会让霍华德过敏发作喘成一颗大水泡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:23.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And finally, its main ingredient is paneer...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:23.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而它的主食材：印度乳酪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:27.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...a farmer's cheese that would cause Leonard to render any room...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:27.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那气味会让莱纳德几分钟内
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.37,0:05:30.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...uninhabitable within minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.37,0:05:30.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将任何房间变成不是人待的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.75,0:05:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:37.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, enjoy your big evening. -Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:37.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好好享受你的精彩夜晚 -佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.55,0:05:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I realize you're also on your own tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.55,0:05:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我发现你今晚也是一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:43.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So if at some point you find yourself with nothing to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:43.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你若觉得无聊没事做
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.84,0:05:45.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...please do not disturb me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.84,0:05:45.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请不要来打扰我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:50.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Have fun, Sheldon. -Oh, I shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:50.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-祝你愉快 谢尔顿 -我会的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:52.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[HUMMING "SUPERMAN" THEME SONG]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.24,0:06:04.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.24,0:06:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.53,0:06:09.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's wrong, Superman? Locked out of your big ice thingy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.53,0:06:09.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？超人 被锁在你的冰块屋外？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.09,0:06:22.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mouthwash, lotion, body wash, shampoo and conditioner...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.09,0:06:22.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}漱口水 乳液 沐浴乳 洗发和润发…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.59,0:06:25.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...together in one tiny bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.59,0:06:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}合装在一个小瓶子里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:27.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爱拉斯维加斯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.43,0:06:31.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Howard, can I borrow some aftershave?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.43,0:06:31.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 刮胡水借用一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:32.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Black case, top compartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:32.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}黑色包 最上层
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:40.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's a lot of cologne.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:40.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也太多瓶了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.36,0:06:42.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: First row are your musks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.36,0:06:42.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第一排是麝香
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:45.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Second is woods, leathers and botanicals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:45.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第二排是木质 皮革 植物香调
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:49.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Third is assorted pheromones. Tread lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第三排是各类费洛蒙 下手轻一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.41,0:06:58.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's the spirit, Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.41,0:06:58.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样就对了 霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:07:01.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:07:01.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们有信心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.67,0:07:04.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.67,0:07:04.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:07.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys go ahead. I just have to finish up an e-mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:07.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们先去 我得写完这封电子邮件
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.18,0:07:11.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's not an e-mail, that's Leslie's Facebook page.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.18,0:07:11.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那哪是电子邮件 那是莱斯丽的交友网页
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:13.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, fine. I'm checking her Facebook page.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:13.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我在看她的交友网页
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.81,0:07:15.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at her status update.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.81,0:07:15.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她更新了状态
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.18,0:07:18.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's saying she dumped me. People need to know I dumped her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.18,0:07:18.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她写她甩了我 大家必须知道是我甩她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.15,0:07:20.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But she did dump you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.15,0:07:20.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但她的确甩了你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.65,0:07:25.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Grow up, Raj. There's no place for truth on the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.65,0:07:25.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}成熟点 拉吉 网上没有说实话的空间
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just go. I'll catch up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快走吧 我随后就到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.45,0:07:32.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.45,0:07:32.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.49,0:07:35.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We should have a plan in case one of us gets lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.49,0:07:35.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先讲好有人有艳遇怎么安排
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:39.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:39.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.42,0:07:42.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I get lucky, I'll take her to my stately manor outside Gotham City...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.42,0:07:42.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有艳遇的话 我会带她回我的蝙蝠侠豪宅
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.09,0:07:47.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and if you get lucky, I'll sleep on the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.09,0:07:47.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若是你有艳遇 我会去月球过夜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.68,0:07:50.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.68,0:07:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听来不错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.35,0:07:55.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on, I think the emergency key is around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.35,0:07:55.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 紧急备用钥匙应该在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.52,0:07:57.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have a bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.52,0:07:57.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们有一个碗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.02,0:08:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Our keys go in a bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.02,0:08:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用来放钥匙的碗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.69,0:08:02.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You should get a bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.69,0:08:02.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该买个碗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.23,0:08:07.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how did the beautiful mind of Sheldon Cooper forget his key in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.23,0:08:07.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如此冰雪聪明的谢尔顿库珀 怎么会忘了带钥匙？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:10.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I left them in the bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:10.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钥匙忘在那个碗里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:13.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-oh. I remembered where the emergency key is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:13.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想起来紧急钥匙在哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.87,0:08:15.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Where? -In your apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.87,0:08:15.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-在哪？ -在你们家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:17.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's it doing in my apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:17.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么会在我们家？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.71,0:08:21.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I went in there a few weeks ago, and you guys weren't home, and I forgot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.71,0:08:21.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}几周前我进去 结果你们在家 我就忘了带走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.25,0:08:24.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You went in my--? Why would--? What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.25,0:08:24.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你进去我…为什么… 是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:27.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not a big deal. I was making coffee and ran out of milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:27.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么事 我在煮咖啡 发现牛奶没了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.55,0:08:30.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're the milk thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.55,0:08:30.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}原来偷奶贼是你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.93,0:08:35.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard said I was crazy, but I knew that carton felt lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.93,0:08:35.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德说我疯了 但我坚信牛奶盒有变轻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.35,0:08:39.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, Sheldon, calm down. I'll call the building manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.35,0:08:39.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 谢尔顿 冷静 我来通知管理员
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.39,0:08:42.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He'll come open your door. Just eat here while you're waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.39,0:08:42.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请他帮你开锁 你在这边吃晚餐边等
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.44,0:08:45.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Eat my dinner in your apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.44,0:08:45.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在你家吃我的晚餐？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:48.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah, why not? -Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:48.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有何不可？ -对 有何不可
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.99,0:08:51.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And after the sun's down, we can all pile in my pickup...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.99,0:08:51.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等太阳下山 我们就搭上我的货车
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:54.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and go skinny-dipping down at the crick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:54.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一起去溪边裸泳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:58.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because today's the day that stopped making sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:58.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为从今天起一切都本末倒置
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:04.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thanks. -I'm telling you, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:04.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢 -说真的 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.42,0:09:08.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Video slots, free drinks brought to us by a bosomy barmaid...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.42,0:09:08.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}电动老虎机 大胸部女服务员送来免费饮料
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.84,0:09:11.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and all-you-can-eat shrimp for 3.95?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.84,0:09:11.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}鲜虾吃到饱只要三点九五元
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:15.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Disneyland can suck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:15.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}迪士尼乐园逊毙了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:21.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is the real happiest place on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:21.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里才真是世上最快乐的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.44,0:09:23.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[COINS JINGLING]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:27.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dude, check it out. That's laundry for a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看 够洗一个月衣服了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.57,0:09:31.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi.
