Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.09,0:14:41.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你和莱纳德是炮友吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:43.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:43.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:45.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you and Leonard friends with benefits?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:45.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你和莱纳德是炮友吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:47.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where did that even come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:47.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你哪来的想法？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.60,0:14:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Did he say we were? -No, Leonard said nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.60,0:14:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他这么说吗？ -不 他什么都没说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.93,0:14:54.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But who knows what goes on over here when he pretends your mail was misdelivered?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.93,0:14:54.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他老是假装有你的信件误送 要拿给你 真的很可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.35,0:14:57.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just mail, no benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.35,0:14:57.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他拿信来 没打炮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.90,0:14:59.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.90,0:14:59.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}了解
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.40,0:15:01.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why are you asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.40,0:15:01.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为何问起？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:04.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm curious about the whole social construct.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:04.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我对这整个社会架构很好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.20,0:15:08.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On its face, the idea of satisfying one's sexual appetite--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.20,0:15:08.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}表面而言 只是满足双方的性需求
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.32,0:15:10.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Assuming one is afflicted with such.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.32,0:15:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}假设某人有这种需求
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.33,0:15:14.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}--without emotional entanglement, that seems imminently practical.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.33,0:15:14.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}却没有情感的纠结 这似乎很实际可行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:20.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What I've observed, however, is Howard Wolowitz crying like a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:20.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然而我所观察到的 却是霍华德哭得像个小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.63,0:15:24.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, some people just can't handle that kind of relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.63,0:15:24.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有些人就是应付不了这种关系
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.47,0:15:27.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.47,0:15:27.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.18,0:15:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.18,0:15:30.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:35.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you able to have sex with men without developing an emotional attachment?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:35.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能和男人发生性关系 却不对他产生感情吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.60,0:15:40.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, I really don't wanna talk about this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.60,0:15:40.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我真的不想和你讨论这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.27,0:15:42.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is this conversation making you uncomfortable?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.27,0:15:42.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谈论这个让你不自在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.48,0:15:44.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course it's making me uncomfortable. Can't you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.48,0:15:44.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然不自在 你看不出来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.07,0:15:46.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.07,0:15:46.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.65,0:15:49.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't particularly excel at reading facial expressions--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.65,0:15:49.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我又不擅长解读他人的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:51.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm uncomfortable, Sheldon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:51.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很不自在！谢尔顿！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.49,0:15:55.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you, that's very helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.49,0:15:55.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 这样很有帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:16:01.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, where are these amazing shrimp?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:16:01.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 神奇巨虾在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.84,0:16:03.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Behold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.84,0:16:03.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:09.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seriously? You think this is the size of a baby's arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:09.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的认为 这个和婴儿的胳臂一样粗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.18,0:16:12.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A little baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.18,0:16:12.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很小的婴儿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.14,0:16:14.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm going back to the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.14,0:16:14.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我回房去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.93,0:16:18.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boy, would it maybe kill them to put out a nice brisket?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.93,0:16:18.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可恶 竟然没有我爱吃的牛腩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:32.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, there. Howard Wolowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:32.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 霍华德沃洛维茨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.82,0:16:34.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ester Rosenblatt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.82,0:16:34.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾丝特罗森布莱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:44.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't think the manager's coming tonight, so here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:44.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想管理员今晚不会来了 给你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.09,0:16:48.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you suggesting I sleep on the couch?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.09,0:16:48.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要我睡在你的沙发上？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.26,0:16:50.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it wasn't the first suggestion that came to mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.26,0:16:50.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也不是很想这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.05,0:16:52.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but it's the one I'm going with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.05,0:16:52.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我不得不收留你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.55,0:16:56.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't sleep on your couch. I sleep in a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.55,0:16:56.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不能睡沙发 我只能睡床上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.56,0:16:59.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Given its dimensions, I have no intention of living out...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.56,0:16:59.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}沙发这么小 我不想演出真人版…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.39,0:17:03.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...E.M. Snickering's beloved children's book, The Tall Man From Cornwall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.39,0:17:03.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}EM史尼克林的畅销童书 《康沃尔郡的巨人》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.48,0:17:06.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.48,0:17:06.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:10.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There was a tall man from Cornwall Whose length exceeded his bed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:10.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝康沃尔郡有个巨人 身高比床铺长
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.24,0:17:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My body fits on it, but barely upon it There's no room for my big Cornish head
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.24,0:17:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的身体塞得下 但是很勉强 我的头没处放 一直晃〞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.75,0:17:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.75,0:17:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 床给你睡 但有一个条件
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:25.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, I will give you my bed on one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.17,0:17:28.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That you promise to zip your hole for the next eight hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.17,0:17:28.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得答应我 闭上你的嘴八小时
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.80,0:17:33.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-May I say one last thing? -Only if it doesn't rhyme.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.80,0:17:33.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我能再说一件事吗？ -只要不押韵就好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.10,0:17:36.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.10,0:17:36.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}简单
