Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.89,0:18:24.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是 -她是妓女 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.94,0:18:27.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A prostitute, yes.
